From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] UiThread: tolerate an unavailable host task profile

The host does not install Android cgroup task profiles. Keep UiThread's stock
lifecycle, with an explicit server-side fallback for this optional grouping.
Thread nice priorities use the native host scheduling boundary.

--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/UiThread.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/UiThread.java
@@ -42,5 +42,6 @@
     public void run() {
         // Make sure UiThread is in the fg stune boost group
-        Process.setThreadGroup(Process.myTid(), Process.THREAD_GROUP_TOP_APP);
+        dev.artzig.system.HostedScheduling.setThreadGroup(
+                Process.myTid(), Process.THREAD_GROUP_TOP_APP);
         super.run();
     }
